    "pros": [
      "Reacts inside the concrete rather than coating it",
      "Maker describes the treatment as permanent",
      "Helps reduce dampness, efflorescence and vapor through the slab",
      "Leaves floors and walls ready for paint or flooring after cure",
      "Water-based and odor-light for indoor work"
